{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/y7ui77","slideIndex":4,"text":"VIDEO TIMING\n2:05-2:20 (15 seconds)\n\nNARRATION\nFor validation, I labeled thirty-five hazards across ten staged photos before running the app. It found thirty-four. AI can still miss small details, so every result keeps human review explicit.\n\nNEXT APP CLIP\n2:20-2:45 - Clip D: Use three prepared shots: dashboard and trend, add a recipient field, and Accessibility."}
